backups/
reference/

# Scratch copy made by tests/lifecycle-test.mjs (now written to TMPDIR).
lifecycle-app/
research/drive/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tools/minutes/fonts/

# Subcontractor meeting minutes carry attendee EMAIL ADDRESSES — including
# personal Yahoo/Gmail accounts, not just company aliases — and this repo is
# PUBLIC. The rendered PDF is named PII for a reason. Same standing rule as
# backups/ and reference/: the toolchain in tools/minutes/ is public, the data
# it reads is not. Keep these beside the repo, not in it.
data/minutes-*.json
out/*.pdf
docs/meeting-*-markup-ledger.txt

# The contact list carries personal cell numbers and personal Gmail/Yahoo/live
# addresses for 50+ subs. This repo is PUBLIC and deploys to Pages, so neither
# the workbook nor any JSON projection of it may be committed — same standing
# rule as backups/ and reference/. Contacts live in Firestore (synced from the
# Sheet by platform/tools/appsscript/SyncContacts.gs); the local working copy
# of the workbook lives in tools/private/.
docs/H2SEP-PhII_Contact-List_*.xlsx
data/contacts.json
tools/private/
